					<div class="kanews-section-heading"><div class="kanews-section-headline"><span>Gündemden Haberler</span></div></div>
										
					<div class="row no-gutters kanews-posts-5-list">
                          <div class="col-12">
                <div class="kanews-post-overlay is-active">
